{"name": "Loot Tower", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras_big/c63b6cb23faafe551717475839a6b3b0.webp?t=1787601264\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/c63b6cb23faafe551717475839a6b3b0.avif?t=1787601264\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight, Loot, Climb, Repeat!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/6628a1cf8b9a7d2443aa266acdcd7bda.poster.avif?t=1787601264\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/6628a1cf8b9a7d2443aa266acdcd7bda.webm?t=1787601264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/6628a1cf8b9a7d2443aa266acdcd7bda.mp4?t=1787601264\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot Tower is an ARPG Bullet Heaven where you battle through hordes of enemies, collect mountains of loot, and increase your power with every run. Fight your way from floor to floor, ascending higher up the tower as you encounter stronger and stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras_big/c454655f7613a3968c577951fc5ccd5f.webp?t=1787601264\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/c454655f7613a3968c577951fc5ccd5f.avif?t=1787601264\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore and Loot the Tower\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/9024f521ed873e67791ce59a84288754.poster.avif?t=1787601264\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/9024f521ed873e67791ce59a84288754.webm?t=1787601264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/9024f521ed873e67791ce59a84288754.mp4?t=1787601264\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore randomly generated floors, unlock devastating abilities that automatically strike enemies, and choose runes and equipment to create synergies that empower your build in unique, powerful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras_big/c63b6cb23faafe551717475839a6b3b0.webp?t=1787601264\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/c63b6cb23faafe551717475839a6b3b0.avif?t=1787601264\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft the Strongest Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565880/extras/b1d72287151126b0e4618efd3dd7809f.poster.avif?t=1787601264\" width=